      "text": "Your statement oversimplifies the complexity of the relationship, as numerous studies have consistently linked heterocyclic amines to increased colorectal cancer risk. A 2015 meta-analysis published in the International Journal of Cancer found a significant association between red meat consumption and colorectal cancer.",
