      "agent_id": "pro_agent",
      "round": 3,
      "text": "The 2015 meta-analysis did find a significant association in high-quality studies, which is a crucial subset of all studies, and this association is a strong indicator of the relationship between red meat consumption and colorectal cancer risk.",
